   "text": "셋째, 바꿔 말한 보기. 그대로 반복한 말, 지문에 없는 말, 반대 말을 지워요.",
   "cap": 50
  },
  {
   "id": "ke25cae9a",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "질문 , 근거 , 바꿔 말하기. 이 순서로 실전 문제를 풀어 볼까요?",
   "cap": 51
  },
  {
   "id": "k2e71dca9",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "실전 문제예요. 자전거 대여 광고와 이메일, 두 글짜리 세트예요. 1번",
   "cap": 52
  },
  {
   "id": "e61c10f86",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Why did Ms Song write the e-mail?",
   "cap": 52
  },
  {
   "id": "k311f3c1d",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "첫째, 목적 문제 , 이메일 첫 문단으로. 둘째",
   "cap": 53
  },
  {
   "id": "ebcdae260",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I am planning a team outing, would like to rent.",
   "cap": 53
  },
  {
   "id": "k877d6faa",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "셋째",
   "cap": 54
  },
  {
   "id": "e2b1ade7c",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "team outing , team event, rent , book.",
   "cap": 54
  },
  {
   "id": "k8c92f8bb",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "2번",
   "cap": 55
  },
  {
   "id": "e812402f9",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What does Ms Song ask about?",
   "cap": 55
  },
  {
   "id": "k8e8a4fe3",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "첫째, 묻는 말은",
   "cap": 55
  },
  {
   "id": "eda0c920e",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Could you tell me whether",
   "cap": 55
  },
  {
   "id": "kbfd3ce21",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "뒤에 있어요.",
   "cap": 55
  },
  {
   "id": "k6367f551",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "둘째, 근거",
   "cap": 56
  },
  {
   "id": "e9ffff956",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "whether we need to bring our own helmets.",
   "cap": 56
  },
  {
   "id": "ee25e1f99",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "helmets , safety gear.",
   "cap": 56
  },
  {
   "id": "k207fe92e",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "주차, 가방 , 지문에 없는 말이라 지워요.",
   "cap": 57
  },
  {
   "id": "kd95c21c6",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "3번은 연계 문제",
   "cap": 58
  },
  {
   "id": "ebe7f8295",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What is indicated about Ms Song's group?",
   "cap": 58
  },
  {
   "id": "k843b57a5",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "두 글을 모두 봐요.",
   "cap": 58
  },
  {
   "id": "ee0bacd35",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Six of us.",
   "cap": 59
  },
  {
   "id": "e7b34c66a",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Groups of five or more receive 20 percent off.",
   "cap": 59
  },
  {
   "id": "k46f27906",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "여섯은 다섯 이상이에요.",
   "cap": 59
  },
  {
   "id": "kd5aec613",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "20",
   "cap": 60
  },
  {
   "id": "e8aae2f15",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "percent off , a lower price.",
   "cap": 60
  },
  {
   "id": "k8c867d07",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "세 문제 모두 근거를 찾고, 바꿔 말한 보기를 골랐어요.",
   "cap": 60
  },
  {
   "id": "kf8fd5063",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "정리해요. 질문 먼저 읽고, 근거를 찾고, 바꿔 말한 보기를 골라요.",
   "cap": 61
  },
  {
   "id": "k9ea3987d",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "목적은 첫 문단, 요청은",
   "cap": 62
  },
  {
   "id": "e6f8bbd34",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "please",
   "cap": 62
  },
  {
   "id": "kdbbd0917",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "뒤, 의도는 바로 앞 메시지, 표는 필요한 칸만.",
   "cap": 62
  },
  {
   "id": "k6fa23f36",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "지문 낱말을 그대로 쓴 보기, 지문에 없는 보기, 반대 보기는 지워요.",
   "cap": 63
  },
  {
   "id": "k1c4b9d86",
   "lang": "ko",
   "text": "아래 근거 사냥 놀이터와 연습 문제로 손에 익혀 보세요.",
   "cap": 64
  },
  {
   "id": "e0d172c1d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Thank you for your interest in the Harborview Inn.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e85f09924",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Unfortunately, all of our rooms are fully booked on March 14 because of the city marathon.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ee7e4a4d0",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "However, our sister hotel, the Bayside Lodge, still has a few rooms left that night.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eac2aac9e",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is a ten-minute walk from the marathon’s starting line.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e83f31f48",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I would be happy to reserve a room there for you at the same rate.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3df63b44",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Please reply by March 6 so that we can hold the room.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1b841b82",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What is indicated about the Harborview Inn?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ea12aece3",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is hosting a city marathon.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e32cdfa0a",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It has no vacancies on March 14.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ede67db74",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is a ten-minute walk from the starting line.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e66b6ddb9",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is offering a discount to runners.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ecd95deef",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "e-mail",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eef0490a2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "notice",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ea7169967",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "advertisement",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e43085c38",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "article",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ee3a37742",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "text-message chain",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e860767dd",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "online chat",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e8856e1f4",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "form",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e76ae3271",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "invoice",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ea91eee47",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "schedule",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb06470ec",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "fully booked, no vacancies",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ed3f78c78",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "at no charge, free",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e0a5d9af1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "postpone, move to a later date",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e22a6dbe9",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "a ten-minute walk, nearby",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e37a61653",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I am writing to let you know that the east elevator will be out of service on Thursday, May 8.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e56d38a55",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A technician will replace its control panel that day.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ecb04e102",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "During the work, please use the west elevator or the stairs.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e3dd29def",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The work should be finished by 5 P.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ec1bae56c",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "If you are expecting a large delivery on Thursday, please contact me by Tuesday.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ebd4de189",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I will ask the delivery company to come on another day.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e97468364",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To report a problem with the stairs",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "edcba86f3",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To announce that an elevator cannot be used for a day",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb525be75",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To ask staff to replace a control panel",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eaf9b9b92",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To introduce a new delivery company",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e4cc61717",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What are employees expecting a large delivery asked to do?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e94bd5f62",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Use the east elevator on Thursday",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6a67be5d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Finish their work by 5 P.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e984b3fc8",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Get in touch with Ms. Lim by Tuesday",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ecf304769",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Help the technician on Thursday",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ea7ffc8b1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The Ridgeway Public Library will hold its annual book sale from July 18 to July 20.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eaf7b54c0",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "More than 5,000 used books will be available, most for under $2.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e14195d34",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Library members may enter one hour early, at 9 A.M., on the first day.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e479dd62b",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "All other visitors are welcome from 10 A.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ed42a0ed1",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Payment can be made in cash or by credit card.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ec546bf28",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "All money raised will go toward new computers for the children’s room.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7b879da7",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "When can library members start shopping on July 18?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e493cd35d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "At 8 A.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ebc69a864",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "At 9 A.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e5b0b1514",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "At 10 A.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1ecd0a26",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "At 2 P.M.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e956896f2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Business cards, 500, $40",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb1911474",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Appointment cards, 1,000, $65",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2b08f075",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Window posters, 2, $30",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ef19923c5",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Total: $135",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ed35e28f7",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Payment due: April 30",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e81c4106d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Pay by April 15 and save 5%.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ea364308e",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "How many appointment cards did the clinic order?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e9f071b55",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What is NOT mentioned about the book sale?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e4c168aff",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It will last for three days.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e664e05e2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Most of the books will cost less than $2.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e0c4e460a",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Shoppers can pay with a credit card.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e433233d2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Volunteers will help carry heavy books.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1830b702",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What is suggested about the Ridgeway Public Library?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7b6f4a7f",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It has held book sales in the past.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6fbb7824",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is closing its children’s room.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7a812a66",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It sells only new books.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eeaeb1e01",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It opens at 9 A.M. every day.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ecc2fcdab",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word “hold” in paragraph 3 is closest in meaning to",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb65ab9c9",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "grasp",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e52b58b8c",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "host",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7e1d7757",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "keep",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eff2f7116",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "contain",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ec85aee3c",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Please reply by March 6 so that we can keep the room.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e965acd56",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The projector in Room 3 won’t turn on, and my client arrives at 11.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e5bb5bb1f",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Is the cable plugged in? It came loose last week.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e506a6bbf",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I checked. That’s not it.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1b3ef227",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "OK. I have a spare projector in my office. I’ll bring it over now.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e4f730208",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "You’re a lifesaver!",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e5231e6e4",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "At 10:14 A.M., what does Ms. Park mean when she writes, “That’s not it”?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e389ce381",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The cable is not causing the problem.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e5759ac0a",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She cannot find Room 3.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e074be87d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Her client has already arrived.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7058758f",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "She has bought a new cable.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e2cfd11ea",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This panel has broken down three times this year.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ebb2a8426",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "What is suggested about Mr. Reyes’s order?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eadf265b9",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Let Greenleaf Catering take care of your next office lunch!",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ede5bc93d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Our Basic package includes sandwiches and a salad for $12 per person.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6d001d48",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Our Deluxe package adds a hot dish and dessert for $18 per person.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e639c5155",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Delivery is free for orders of 30 people or more.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ecb1d8406",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I would like to order your Deluxe package for our staff meeting on June 9.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e51fab7dd",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "There will be 25 of us.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e41b5acbe",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Could you deliver the food to our office by 11:30 A.M.?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ee0002173",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It will be delivered at no cost.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ef923514e",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It will include sandwiches only.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e1284761f",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It does not qualify for free delivery.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e9f0224ab",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It was placed after the meeting.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7653b2d3",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Where will Ms. Bell’s workshop most likely be held?",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ebc640be4",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Name, Nora Bell",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e0f3c73f5",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Company, Pinecrest Logistics",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e582cc7a2",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Workshop, Writing Clear E-mails",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e91d285cc",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Payment, By credit card",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e656b8927",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "9:00 A.M., Writing Clear E-mails, Room B",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e6d64d2d8",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "11:00 A.M., Leading Short Meetings, Room A",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e689fc9d0",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "2:00 P.M., Presenting with Data, Room C",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "eb2c6c328",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Room B will be painted on October 11.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "ec610c40d",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The workshop planned for that room will be held in Room D instead.",
   "from": "say"
  },
  {
   "id": "e7f871662",
